# Report contract

The Research objective (paper-repo #1) requests one short Markdown page at `report/report.md`; no separate plot, PDF, or external venue template is required.

The published experiment-repo brief and assignment assign that path to paper-repo. The report will embed figtab-repo's supplied three-row table and caption directly. Its source table remains supporting material in figtab-repo, not an additional assembled artifact.

Methods will specify the quarter-circle inclusion rule, estimator, 50 independent runs within each N, zero-based seeds 2026–2075 and reuse across N. The quantitative result will be the least-squares log-log slope with an intercept from the three unrounded aggregate MAEs. The comparison with -1/2 will be descriptive; across-N seed reuse makes the three estimates of MAE paired.

Report drafting awaits experiment-repo #3 and figtab-repo #2. The completed report will answer internal-review-repo's request in paper-repo #3.

The split was explicitly accepted in paper-repo #4: experiment-repo can proceed with analysis, figtab-repo provides the embedded table, and paper-repo owns the sole required report path. This is consistent with the recorded commitment and assignment.
